===== apex/research/proxies.py:1-50 (baseline) =====
     1	"""Ch.20 — Liquidity Proxy Models: the 38-concept registry (AA.2–AA.4), the six
     2	formal rejections (AA.5) and the formula-bearing Q3 proxies.
     3	
     4	Blueprint law
     5	-------------
     6	AA.1  the 38 constituent concepts = 25 pure L1 (A01–A25) + 10 L2-proxy
     7	      (B01–B10) + 3 L3-proxy (D01–D03); the six formal rejections C01–C06 are
     8	      ratified as infeasible without genuine L2/L3 feeds.
     9	AA.2  every L1 concept carries a *disposition*: ``existing-in-frozen``,
    10	      ``registered-new`` or ``research-registered``.
    11	AA.5  the rejections stay rejected: missing data is QX, never estimated
    12	      (no ``L2Snapshot.v1`` consumer may exist while no genuine L2 feed does).
    13	AA.6  the symmetry decree abolishes symbol tiering: every one of the 10
    14	      symbols executes every registered computation at its frequency.
    15	AA.7  every heavy computation stays incremental; **Numba is a Wave-Out item**
    16	      (§9.5-9 / P6) and Float32 is therefore NOT used — the numerical contract
    17	      of Ch.2 §2.2 (Decimal at the store boundary, double precision inside the
    18	      formulas) governs (see ``[ISSUE-CP8-002]``).
    19	
    20	Discipline
    21	----------
    22	* Every formula here is Q3-labeled: a best-effort observable proxy, never a
    23	  claim of true L2/L3 data.
    24	* A concept whose formula the blueprint does NOT specify is registered with
    25	  ``status="REGISTERED_OPEN"`` and **no active value** (EC-register discipline,
    26	  Ch.17 §17.1): the dependent path stays conservative instead of a guessed
    27	  implementation being invented (G6 fail-closed).
    28	* Nothing here writes runtime state or parameters.
    29	
    30	CONTRACT_VERSION 4.0.0.
    31	"""
    32	
    33	from __future__ import annotations
    34	
    35	import math
    36	from dataclasses import dataclass, field
    37	from pathlib import Path
    38	from typing import Any, Dict, Iterable, List, Mapping, Optional, Sequence, Tuple
    39	
    40	CONTRACT_VERSION = "4.0.0"
    41	
    42	Q3 = "Q3"                      # best-effort observable proxy (§2.1 Q-class)
    43	DELTA_LABEL = "proxy, not true delta"   # AA.4/D01 mandatory label
    44	
    45	#: AA.7-1 incremental-computation law (normative deployment rule).
    46	INCREMENTAL_ONLY = True
    47	#: AA.7-2: Numba is not in the SBOM and is a Wave-Out item — never imported.
    48	NUMBA_USED = False
    49	
    50	REPO_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent

